This repository and all of its contents — including the game source (`yildiz-akini.html`), the Android package, documentation, screenshots, cover art, icon, and all procedurally generated audiovisual assets — are the property of Saklabann and are protected by copyright law.

Without prior written permission, you may not:

- copy, reproduce, or redistribute all or any part of the contents;
- distribute modified versions;
- use the contents commercially, sell them, or include them in another product;
- create and share derivative works from the source code.

You may download and play the game for personal, non-commercial use. When sharing the game with friends, please link to this repository or the official download instead of redistributing the files.

**Third-party exception.** Kenney Space Shooter Redux and ambientCG Metal032 assets in the embedded art pack are used under CC0 1.0; NASA imagery is used as public domain. Those assets are not covered by this proprietary license. Sources, identifiers and modification records are listed in [CREDITS.md](CREDITS.md). The six hand-drawn gallery references remain all rights reserved to the project's artist archive.

